  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Dignity in Care &quot;Serving 500 PWDs in Pakistan&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to empower 500 individuals with severe disabilities in Pakistan through a comprehensive program that focuses on providing independent living skills and support services. Currently most of them confined to their homes, facing isolation and neglect, as their families perceive them as burdens and often do not provide the care and attention they need. Our initiative seeks to break this cycle of isolation and neglect by offering a two-fold approach (Attendant Service &amp; IL Trainings).</narrative>
  </description>
